<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
a result, the Amendment was duly approved by the Company&#8217;s stockholders representing a majority of the then outstanding shares
of the Company&#8217;s common stock entitled to vote at the Special Meeting. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
final decision of whether to proceed with the Amendment, and shall be determined by our board of directors, in its discretion, at any
time prior to August 23, 2023, the deadline for regaining compliance with Nasdaq Listing Rule 5550(a)(2).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2.
Approval of proposal to adjourn the Special Meeting to a later date or dates to permit further solicitation and vote of proxies in the
event there are insufficient votes for the approval of the reverse stock s</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

